# Backend (Laravel)

## Structure

- Controllers: `app/Http/Controllers/Api/V1/` — thin, use `RespondsWithJson`
- Services: `app/Services/{Module}/` — extend `BaseService`
- Repositories: `app/Repositories/Eloquent/` — extend `BaseEloquentRepository`
- DTOs: `app/DTOs/` — readonly data objects for service layer
- Contracts: `app/Contracts/Repositories/`, `app/Contracts/Services/`
- Responses: `App\Http\Responses\ApiResponse` — never hand-roll JSON envelopes
- Exceptions: throw `BusinessException` subclasses from services

## Code style

- `declare(strict_types=1);` in all PHP files
- Run `composer format` (Pint) before commit
- PHPStan level 6: `composer analyse`

## Testing

- Pest tests in `tests/Feature/` and `tests/Unit/`
- Run `composer test` or `php artisan test`

## API docs

- Scramble auto-generates OpenAPI from routes/controllers
- UI: `/docs/api` | Export: `scripts/openapi.ps1`

## Response format

```json
{ "success": true, "data": {}, "message": "optional" }
```

Errors use standard Laravel validation / HTTP status codes.
